WEBVTT

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:06.703
Now, a miracle is about to be
created upon this planet.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:31.264
Feel how filthy your body is...

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:35.394
...and what it means to be alive.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:42.601
You are now standing at
the crossroads of destiny.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.286
Hey, what do you want from me?!

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.821
Juna!

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.413
Tokio!

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.518
Juna!

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.252
Juna!

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:29.415
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:36.722
Episode 3: Tears of the Forest

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:39.933
Over the Japan Alps

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.867
Over the Japan Alps

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:41.492
I want my Juna back!

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.801
It's strange of you to say that.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:48.367
Do you own her?

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.913
Oh, that wasn't me just now.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:56.006
Chris said it.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.884
Wh-Who are you guys...?

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.586
I'm Cindy.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:02.088
I'm like an interpreter
for Chris so he can...

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.224
...talk to simpletons like you.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:06.226
Then why don't you ask him this.

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.421
What's he doing with Juna?

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.586
Chris can hear what
you're saying.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:15.535
Juna's going to be spending
some time on her own.

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:18.265
This is going to be her
survival training. So, there.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.806
That's crazy!

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.442
Leave an ordinary girl alone
in the mountains...

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.376
...and she'll die the first night!

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.116
One person's life...

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.947
...weighs heavier than the earth.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:34.387
That may sound nice and all...

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.990
...but the earth is reaching
its sustainable limit...

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:40.448
...and it has no choice but
to force a girl to make a sacrifice.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.131
I don't like to say this...

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:47.000
...but you should forget about her.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.401
What...?!

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:51.996
Besides, you both have totally
different spiritual vibes.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:55.708
It's incredible that you can
even be girlfriend and boyfriend.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:58.506
Oh, those were my words.

00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.712
What?

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.514
When your spiritual vibes
are at odds...

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.916
...that's bad.

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:03.983
You little brat!

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:05.917
Who do you think you are?!

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:09.322
I mean, it was like that
with my mom and dad.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:11.691
They always fought over me.

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:14.427
In the end, my dad shot my mom
with a hunting rifle...

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.793
...and then he killed himself.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:18.724
You're kidding, right?

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.297
Did you believe me?

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:24.268
What the...?
You were joking?

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:46.916
Rain?

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:04.143
We'll deliver your motorcycle,
so don't you worry about that.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:08.147
Oh, you can tell
other people about us...

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:11.117
...but they're just going to think
you're talking nonsense.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.345
Bye.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.451
Juna!

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:57.630
I'm coming, Juna!

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:00.924
Juna...!

00:05:09.709 --> 00:05:11.511
And in the mountains...

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:15.581
...there will be some heavy rains
from evening into early morning.

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:17.378
Next on the news...

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.886
At 5:20,
late yesterday afternoon...

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:24.757
...an accident occurred at the
Dogasaki Nuclear Power Plant.

00:05:24.757 --> 00:05:26.793
According to plant authorities...

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:27.460
...only a minute amount...

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.862
What a bunch of lies.

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:33.266
It really is all lies.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:37.637
The doctor at the hospital
lies about Juna dying...

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:41.374
...and my husband lies about
splitting up with that woman...

00:05:41.374 --> 00:05:45.970
...and even you tell me that some
foreigners have taken Juna away.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.116
Saving the planet, huh?

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:52.346
Maybe you've been watching
too much TV.

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:56.315
They're just going to think
you're talking nonsense.

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:06.163
That girl wasn't born
until past her due date.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:10.002
Unlike Kaine,
her sister who's four years older...

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:12.004
...hers was such a difficult birth.

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:14.040
Thanks to the help of the doctors...

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.477
...I somehow managed
to give birth to her safely.

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:21.481
She's always been a rambunctious
girl since she was born.

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:24.416
She sure had a lot of energy.

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:37.730
Her father and I got divorced.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:42.167
That day, when Juna was in
that accident, it became official.

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:49.709
And she got all upset and
took off from the hospital, right?

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:53.577
She probably doesn't want me
to know where she is.

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:56.908
But that's okay with me.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:07:00.418
As long as she's alive.

00:08:13.559 --> 00:08:15.254
No!

00:08:24.904 --> 00:08:26.633
Game set.

00:08:28.641 --> 00:08:32.668
Who would've thought the chosen
one would be a girl like that?

00:08:35.081 --> 00:08:38.718
I know. You didn't have
anyone else you could choose.

00:08:38.718 --> 00:08:40.583
I know that.

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.812
I must've fallen from there.

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.014
Water...

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:16.381
Water...

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.987
Water...

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.359
Water...

00:09:35.107 --> 00:09:36.665
Water...

00:09:38.377 --> 00:09:39.469
Water...

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:49.145
You can't drink this water.

00:09:50.056 --> 00:09:52.786
What?! But, why not?

00:10:28.361 --> 00:10:32.661
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:41.674
Hey, Tokio.

00:10:41.674 --> 00:10:43.709
You're by yourself today?

00:10:43.709 --> 00:10:47.747
Come to think of it, I haven't seen
Juna around at summer practice.

00:10:47.747 --> 00:10:49.415
Did something happen?

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:50.416
Who knows.

00:10:50.416 --> 00:10:52.752
That's not a good answer.

00:10:52.752 --> 00:10:56.381
Weren't you the one who was
supposed to protect her?

00:10:56.589 --> 00:11:00.192
Besides, you both have totally
different spiritual vibes.

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:03.093
It's incredible that you can
even be girlfriend and boyfriend.

00:11:03.729 --> 00:11:06.163
Japan's Strange
Rock Formations Top 100

00:11:08.768 --> 00:11:09.598
Huh?

00:11:22.114 --> 00:11:23.411
That's the spot.

00:11:32.892 --> 00:11:34.450
Moto-Koh...

00:11:35.061 --> 00:11:37.797
Extra-large curry rice from La Nino.

00:11:37.797 --> 00:11:43.633
Canal Town...
Sebastian's blueberry waffles.

00:11:44.036 --> 00:11:46.706
Soba from Ejima.

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:48.401
Harborland...

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:07.188
Darn! It's a dead end.

00:13:28.407 --> 00:13:29.999
Everyone's eating...

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.512
They didn't have to be
taught anything...

00:13:33.512 --> 00:13:36.615
...but they know what they can eat.

00:13:36.615 --> 00:13:38.549
But I can't... I...

00:13:39.318 --> 00:13:41.020
That's strange...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.250
That's really strange...

00:14:07.079 --> 00:14:09.915
Tl-2. Significant drop
in biological response.

00:14:09.915 --> 00:14:11.405
That's a problem.

00:14:12.785 --> 00:14:15.187
Hey, Captain.
Standby for rescue.

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:18.315
What's the rush, all of a sudden?

00:14:20.359 --> 00:14:23.762
That ugly girl probably
just realized it now.

00:14:23.762 --> 00:14:26.632
That she's just
a pathetic life form...

00:14:26.632 --> 00:14:29.101
...that can't even tell what
she can or can't eat.

00:14:29.101 --> 00:14:30.500
Right, Chris?

00:14:31.837 --> 00:14:34.506
Chris, whatever you may say...

00:14:34.506 --> 00:14:36.208
...I think this is her limit.

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:39.234
- Her bio response is weak.
Still dropping.
- What?

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:41.180
Long ago, in ancient times...

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:45.651
...one of those chosen
as a priest of the gods...

00:14:45.651 --> 00:14:48.120
...set out alone into
the catacombs...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.824
...below the shrine of the
goddess of fertility.

00:14:51.824 --> 00:14:55.954
He survived for many days
without water or food.

00:14:56.962 --> 00:14:58.230
And during that time...

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.567
...his duty was to report
all of the happenings...

00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:07.233
...in the world that he sensed
by resonating with the planet.

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:11.243
But a mountain range
is not a shrine.

00:15:11.243 --> 00:15:14.213
There's too much risk for a novice
like her who has barely awakened.

00:15:14.213 --> 00:15:16.982
This is clearly different.

00:15:16.982 --> 00:15:20.920
This is not a man-made structure
like a shrine.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:24.048
The mountain is the true shrine.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.385
The true shrine...

00:15:41.907 --> 00:15:43.374
Ow...

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:46.011
Klutz...

00:15:46.011 --> 00:15:47.746
That's totally bogus.

00:15:47.746 --> 00:15:50.010
They lied about being able to
set it up in five minutes.

00:16:06.498 --> 00:16:08.329
Meriken burger...

00:16:20.312 --> 00:16:21.540
Juna...

00:16:22.848 --> 00:16:24.475
Tokio...

00:16:29.154 --> 00:16:30.781
A dream...

00:16:34.093 --> 00:16:35.560
I'm still...

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:43.635
...alive.

00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:43.062
Earth sympathy wave!
Reaching the 2nd tier.

00:17:43.062 --> 00:17:44.188
No way...

00:18:11.557 --> 00:18:13.821
The bugs are glowing.

00:18:16.161 --> 00:18:17.287
Glowing...

00:18:18.263 --> 00:18:20.432
The mountains too...

00:18:20.432 --> 00:18:21.922
And me, too...

00:18:36.448 --> 00:18:38.183
That stinks! Huh?

00:18:38.183 --> 00:18:39.775
What the heck is that?

00:18:45.557 --> 00:18:47.616
What is this place?

00:18:56.702 --> 00:18:58.067
Tokio?

00:19:31.737 --> 00:19:33.906
The Aura Wave has hit!

00:19:34.973 --> 00:19:36.440
I'm sure it was a fluke.

00:19:36.608 --> 00:19:38.337
The fool...

00:19:38.911 --> 00:19:40.435
Chris?

00:19:47.653 --> 00:19:49.621
Could that be...
Juna?!

00:20:00.098 --> 00:20:01.133
Why kill?

00:20:01.133 --> 00:20:02.100
Chris!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:04.636
It tried to hurt Tokio.

00:20:04.636 --> 00:20:07.306
Besides,
you told me to protect the earth!

00:20:07.306 --> 00:20:10.042
You're going to kill just for that?

00:20:10.042 --> 00:20:11.543
Just for that?

00:20:11.543 --> 00:20:13.101
Juna!

00:20:13.278 --> 00:20:14.379
Tokio?!

00:20:14.379 --> 00:20:16.215
You're still alive, Juna!

00:20:16.215 --> 00:20:17.307
No...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.418
Get out of the way!

00:20:19.418 --> 00:20:21.283
Why do you kill?

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:24.348
What?!

00:20:56.555 --> 00:20:59.625
You really came to find me,
Tokio.

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:01.456
Of course I did.

00:21:01.827 --> 00:21:05.024
But how did you know
I was here?

00:21:06.431 --> 00:21:08.797
Call it the vibes of your spirit.

00:21:10.602 --> 00:21:12.638
Tokio. You stink.

00:21:12.638 --> 00:21:14.663
That's not true.
And what about you?

00:21:21.213 --> 00:21:23.115
I see.

00:21:23.115 --> 00:21:27.449
The chemicals from this dump
polluted that lake.

00:21:30.756 --> 00:21:34.783
I wonder how far this goes for?

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.393
Who knows.

00:21:37.629 --> 00:21:42.328
Maybe down this mountain
and all the way to the sea.

00:21:42.901 --> 00:21:44.562
The sea, huh?

00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:49.907
There's nothing we can do.
It's the way things are.

00:21:52.444 --> 00:21:56.744
Isn't there anything we can do?
Can't we change this?

00:21:57.115 --> 00:21:59.083
I doubt we could do anything.

00:22:00.452 --> 00:22:02.386
No matter what?

00:22:02.754 --> 00:22:03.846
Probably.

00:22:19.237 --> 00:22:23.367
Arjuna

00:22:26.445 --> 00:22:33.009
I set my sights far away

00:22:33.518 --> 00:22:39.024
Over and over, I call out your name

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:45.122
Beyond time and the heavens

00:22:46.198 --> 00:22:53.798
I want to say I'm protecting you

00:22:56.441 --> 00:23:01.747
Even the cool air

00:23:01.747 --> 00:23:05.308
Has penetrated deep in my heart

00:23:05.884 --> 00:23:14.259
It won't steal the warmth

00:23:14.259 --> 00:23:23.335
How fleeting my love still is

00:23:23.335 --> 00:23:29.740
I aim my sights far away

00:23:30.342 --> 00:23:35.781
Over and over, I call out your name

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:41.981
Beyond time and the heavens

00:23:43.021 --> 00:23:51.121
I want to say I'm protecting you

00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:15.344
I learned while I was
deep in the mountains.

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:18.623
The deepest darkness...
The loneliness of solitude...

00:24:18.623 --> 00:24:20.113
The deepest darkness...
The loneliness of solitude...

00:24:21.126 --> 00:24:24.863
That I am a fragile life that
doesn't even know...

00:24:24.863 --> 00:24:27.764
...what food to look for.

00:24:28.266 --> 00:24:28.467
No Tilling
Encounter
Entropy
Insects

00:24:28.467 --> 00:24:31.470
No Tilling
Encounter
Entropy
Insects

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:33.738
You have not realized anything.

00:24:33.738 --> 00:24:35.674
What?! What do you mean?

00:24:35.674 --> 00:24:37.442
Nothing will change if you
only learn in your mind.

00:24:37.442 --> 00:24:38.810
Nothing will change if you
only learn in your mind.

00:24:38.810 --> 00:24:39.208
Nothing will change if you
only learn in your mind.

00:24:39.578 --> 00:24:45.244
Not until you feel the endless
flow of life with your own senses.

00:24:49.754 --> 00:24:51.756
Episode 4
Transmigration
